## ==========================================================
##  .gitignore for AmdPanel (VS 2022 / .NET 8 / C++ / WPF)
##  third_party/ADLXSDK сохраняется в репозитории.
## ==========================================================

## --- Visual Studio ---
.vs/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.userprefs

## --- Build output (любая конфигурация) ---
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
x64/
x86/
*.dll.config
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.exp
*.map
*.lib
*.exe.config

## --- Native C++ build artefacts ---
*.aps
*.tlog
*.lastbuildstate
*.unsuccessfulbuild
*.cache
*.idb
*.ipdb
*.iobj
*.obj
BuildLog.htm
*.VC.db
*.VC.VC.opendb
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.opendb

## --- .NET artefacts ---
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
artifacts/
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets

## --- NuGet ---
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
.nuget/

## --- Test / coverage ---
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
[Bb]uild[Ll]og.*
TestResults/
coverage*.xml
coverage*.json
coverage*/

## --- Release staging (создаётся build.ps1) ---
dist/

## --- Local user data (на dev-машине при запуске AmdPanel.exe) ---
*.local.json
profiles/
backups/
registry-tasks/
settings.local.json

## --- IDE / editors ---
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.vscode/
*.code-workspace

## --- OS metadata ---
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

## --- Logs ---
*.log
logs/

## --- Package managers local cache ---
node_modules/
package-lock.json
yarn.lock

## --- ВАЖНО: third_party/ADLXSDK НЕ игнорируется ---
## SDK распространяется по лицензии AMD и должен быть в репозитории
## для воспроизводимой сборки.
!third_party/
!third_party/ADLXSDK/
